                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Column chart of how many listings fall in each vote band: no votes, 1 to 9, 10 to 99, 100 to 999, and 1,000 or more. The finding is that attention is scarcer than money: the bands below the disclosed evidence floor of 100 votes hold the great majority of listings. This chart is the only cross-filter source on the page; selecting a band filters the perfect-tens table.'"
